# Run r1102b, slice 2, boot O0: the OLD world for SQ-RD-03, SQ-DF-07 and SQ-RSP-14. Group A (superflat), level s2a.
# Pre-boot (s2_setup.md, O0): prep_srv.sh OUT s2a A; copy rusticdelight-forge-1.19.2-1.3.0.jar and
# Delightful-1.19.2-3.4.1.jar from development/creativeDelight/jar_archive/displaced/ into OUT/srv/mods/ (a jar in mods/
# always beats the nested member, CreativeDelight.warnIfNotNested). This boot leaves the marker tagged s2home and the
# old blocks; s2_A.qb boots the same world without the two jars and checks them.
# Offsets from H (y = H2, the air layer above the superflat grass): Rustic 1.3.0 lane z+0 (x+2..+20), Delightful 3.4.1
# lane z+3, Kettle lane z+6. Everything else s2_A.qb builds sits at z >= +10.
pace 2

## SQ-RD-03a | old world: Rustic 1.3.0 and Delightful 3.4.1 standalone, blocks placed
bootexpect Done \(
bootexpect member rusticdelight is loaded from rusticdelight-forge-1\.19\.2-1\.3\.0\.jar
bootexpect member delightful is loaded from Delightful-1\.19\.2-3\.4\.1\.jar
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s2home] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["s2home"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s2home,limit=1] Pos
capture H entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> forceload add {H1-16} {H3-16} {H1+80} {H3+176}
sleep 5
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> weather clear 100000
> fill {H1} {H2} {H3} {H1+22} {H2+3} {H3+8} minecraft:air
> fill {H1} {H2-1} {H3} {H1+22} {H2-1} {H3+8} minecraft:grass_block
# honey pancakes eaten to 3 (1.3.0 servings = bites eaten: 3 eaten = 3 left), chocolate untouched
> setblock {H1+2} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:honey_pancakes[servings=3]
> setblock {H1+3} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:chocolate_pancakes
> setblock {H1+4} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:bell_pepper_red_crate
> setblock {H1+5} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:cotton_boll_crate
> setblock {H1+6} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:coffee_beans_bag
> setblock {H1+8} {H2-1} {H3} minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock {H1+8} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:bell_peppers[age=4]
> setblock {H1+9} {H2-1} {H3} minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock {H1+9} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:cotton[age=2]
> setblock {H1+10} {H2-1} {H3} minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> setblock {H1+10} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:coffee[age=3]
> setblock {H1+12} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:wild_bell_peppers
> setblock {H1+13} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:wild_coffee
> setblock {H1+14} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:wild_cotton
> setblock {H1+16} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:potted_wild_coffee
> setblock {H1+17} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:cherry_blossom_cheesecake
reject Could not set the block|Unknown block|Invalid block state|Unknown block property
> execute if block {H1+2} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:honey_pancakes[servings=3] run say RD03a pancakes servings 3
> execute if block {H1+16} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:potted_wild_coffee run say RD03a potted coffee
expect RD03a pancakes servings 3
expect RD03a potted coffee
# the crop ages are written down for s2_A.qb (crops do not random-tick without a player, so they stay)
> execute if block {H1+8} {H2} {H3} rusticdelight:bell_peppers[age=4] run say RD03a pepper crop age 4
expect RD03a pepper crop age 4

