## SQ-RSP-14a | old world: a Kettle saved at water_level=3
> setblock {H1+2} {H2} {H3+6} minecraft:campfire[lit=true]
> setblock {H1+2} {H2+1} {H3+6} farmersrespite:kettle[water_level=3]
> execute if block {H1+2} {H2+1} {H3+6} farmersrespite:kettle[water_level=3] run say RSP14a kettle 3
expect RSP14a kettle 3
> save-all flush
waitlog Saved the game 120
